# Density Compare
# Darmstadtium (Ds) — real density 34.8 g/cm³. equal masses: Darmstadtium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Darmstadtium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 6.1mm color: #ff30d0 at (-20mm, 3.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 277.6 g — the water cube is the reference
